Subject: [PATCH] fix: Escape user data outside event fields

Escape the user e-mail in the navbar, the user name in both dashboards
and the flash type and text. Move the page title escape from
EventsController::show to the layout, so it is escaped once on output,
and replace the short open tag in the flash partial.
